 How To Run
From Terminal
hadoop jar YourJarName.jar mrLogFile_demo.UserLogDriver /input/log.txt /output/maxip

From Eclipse

Run → Run Configurations

Java Application → Arguments

Program Arguments:

/input/log.txt /output/maxip

